<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Get</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>get &lt;item&gt;
get &lt;item&gt; from &lt;container&gt;
get all
get all from &lt;container&gt;
get money
get &lt;amount&gt; &lt;coins&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>get all from corpse
get butter bread from bag
get all
get 10 gold
get sword from 2.corpse
</pre>
<p>If you see an item lying around and want to pick it up, use this command. If 
there is an item in a container that you wish to get, name the container after 
the word from: get all corpse doesn't work, get all from corpse does. If there 
are several things with the same name, 2.corpse is the second one. get money 
picks up only the coins. Take works just the same as get.
</p><p>You can only take things from your own corpse, not from another player's.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Drop</a>
